      "content": "\"better days\" feels so fake though. everyone is just looking at me like i'm some kind of pariah. it's like i'm living in a world that doesn't even want me anymore. it's just empty. what's even the point of trying to fix things when the whole system just crushed me for being honest? it feels like i'm just waiting for nothing.",
